# Build output of `bun --cwd=packages/natives run gen:native`, consumed by
# `bun build --compile` and deleted again by `gen:native:reset`. An interrupted
# binary build leaves it behind; it must never be committed (tens of MB).
# Upstream already ignores the sibling `*.node` artifacts and the mupdf wasm
# copy, but missed this one.
embedded-addons.*.tar.gz
